<title>FRANCE: TENNIS-LYON GRAND PRIX RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-LYON GRAND PRIX RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LYON, France 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results in the $750,000 Lyon men's tennis Grand Prix on Thursday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Second round:</p>
<p>Karol Kucera (Slovakia) beat Younes El Aynaoui (Morocco) 7-5 6-2</p>
<p>Arnaud Boetsch (France) beat Andrei Chesnokov (Russia) 6-7 (5-7) 5-4 40-30  - Chesnokov retired injured</p>
</text>
